  "body": "Terminal TUI usability improvements:\n\n- Added alphabetical duplicate-group sorting by file path via `3`; `s` now cycles total size, duplicate count, and alphabetical sorting.\n- Updated the TUI footer legend to show all three sort options clearly.\n- Added `c` collapse all and `o` open all shortcuts for duplicate groups.\n- Let the terminal TUI use the full terminal width instead of capping at 120 columns, so long paths are less aggressively truncated.\n- Bumped the source version to `0.7.0`."
